{
  "Package": "MOGAMUN",
  "Type": "Package",
  "Title": "MOGAMUN: A Multi-Objective Genetic Algorithm to Find Active\nModules in Multiplex Biological Networks",
  "Version": "1.21.0",
  "Authors@R": "person(\"Elva-Mar\u00eda\", \"Novoa-del-Toro\", role=c(\"aut\", \"cre\"),\nemail=\"elvanov@hotmail.com\", comment=c(ORCID = \"0000-0002-6135-5839\"))",
  "Description": "MOGAMUN is a multi-objective genetic algorithm that\nidentifies active modules in a multiplex biological network.\nThis allows analyzing different biological networks at the same\ntime. MOGAMUN is based on NSGA-II (Non-Dominated Sorting\nGenetic Algorithm, version II), which we adapted to work on\nnetworks.",
